# ☕ Coffee Machine Project

## Description
This is a Python Coffee Machine project that simulates a real coffee vending machine. Users can order coffee, insert coins, receive change, and view the machine's resource report.

## Features
- ☕ Order Latte, Espresso, or Cappuccino
- 💰 Coin payment system
- 💵 Calculates and returns change
- 📊 Displays machine resource report
- 🔒 Turn the machine off using the `off` command

